title: VendingMachine
---
<<declare $monster_cans = 0>>
<<if $monster_cans == 0>>
  A vending machine full of Monster Energy drinks. You have enough money for one. 
  Would you like the purchase a Monster?
  -> Yes
    <<PlaySoundAndWait InteractionManager "Vending Machine Dispense" 1.5>>
    <<PlaySoundAndWait InteractionManager "Vending Machine Can Drop" 1>>
    <<PlaySound InteractionManager "Pickup">>
    You got a Monster!
    <<set $monster_cans += 1>>
  -> No
<<elseif $monster_cans == 1>>
  A vending machine full of your favorite drinks. Sadly, you cannot afford anything.
<<endif>>

===
